{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "ely-native-full",
  "requires_real_provider": true,
  "requires_journal": true,
  "requires_network_trace": true,
  "native_general_settings": {
    "appearance": "dark",
    "fontFamily": "系统默认",
    "fontSizePx": 14,
    "density": "compact",
    "reducedMotion": true
  },
  "visual": {
    "logicalWidth": 1280,
    "logicalHeight": 820,
    "physicalClientWidth": 2560,
    "physicalClientHeight": 1640,
    "dpi": 192,
    "deviceScaleFactor": 2,
    "theme": "dark",
    "sourceBaseline": "out/ely-native/zcode-windows-reference-6/native-run"
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "focus"
    },
    {
      "type": "resize_client",
      "width": 2560,
      "height": 1640
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_window",
      "title_contains": "KeenCode",
      "client_width": 2560,
      "client_height": 1640,
      "dpi": 192
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "startup"
    },
    {
      "type": "accessibility",
      "label": "startup"
    },
    {
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "startup"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 142
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "session_created",
      "count": 1,
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "session-created"
    },
    {
      "type": "accessibility",
      "label": "session-created"
    },
    {
      "type": "click_accessibility",
      "label": "变更前确认",
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "permission-options"
    },
    {
      "type": "click_accessibility",
      "label": "自动编辑",
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "automatic-edit-selected"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 880
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "type_text",
      "text": "本轮验收只允许调用 Read 和 Write 两个工具，不要使用 Bash 或其他工具。请先使用 Read 读取 src/facts.txt，然后使用 Write 创建 out/native-acceptance/result.txt。文件内容必须精确等于以下标记，不能添加其他字符或换行： KEENCODE_NATIVE_ACCEPTANCE_MARKER_20261005。Write 成功后直接简短回答，不要再调用任何工具验证文件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "type": "key",
      "key": "enter"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "turn_started",
      "count": 1,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "turn-started"
    },
    {
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "turn-started"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_requested",
      "count": 1,
      "matching": {
        "/payload/request/toolName": "Read",
        "/payload/request/effect": "read_only"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "matching_project_paths": {
        "/payload/request/arguments/file_path": "src/facts.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_requested",
      "count": 1,
      "matching": {
        "/payload/request/toolName": "Write",
        "/payload/request/arguments/content": "KEENCODE_NATIVE_ACCEPTANCE_MARKER_20261005",
        "/payload/request/effect": "changes_state"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "matching_project_paths": {
        "/payload/request/arguments/file_path": "out/native-acceptance/result.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_execution_started",
      "count": 2,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_completed",
      "count": 2,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_file",
      "path": "out/native-acceptance/result.txt",
      "contains": "KEENCODE_NATIVE_ACCEPTANCE_MARKER_20261005",
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "turn_completed",
      "count": 1,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "turn-completed"
    },
    {
      "type": "accessibility",
      "label": "turn-completed"
    },
    {
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "turn-completed"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "x": 180,
      "y": 670
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "session-reopened"
    },
    {
      "type": "accessibility",
      "label": "session-reopened"
    },
    {
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "session-reopened"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1380
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "type_text",
      "text": "会话重开后本轮只允许调用一次 Write，不要使用 Bash 或其他工具。请创建 out/native-acceptance/second-result.txt，文件内容必须精确等于以下标记，不能添加其他字符或换行： KEENCODE_NATIVE_ACCEPTANCE_SECOND_MARKER_20261005。Write 成功后直接简短确认，不要再调用任何工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "type": "key",
      "key": "enter"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "turn_started",
      "count": 2,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_requested",
      "count": 1,
      "matching": {
        "/payload/request/toolName": "Write",
        "/payload/request/arguments/content": "KEENCODE_NATIVE_ACCEPTANCE_SECOND_MARKER_20261005",
        "/payload/request/effect": "changes_state"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "matching_project_paths": {
        "/payload/request/arguments/file_path": "out/native-acceptance/second-result.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_execution_started",
      "count": 3,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_file",
      "path": "out/native-acceptance/second-result.txt",
      "contains": "KEENCODE_NATIVE_ACCEPTANCE_SECOND_MARKER_20261005",
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "tool_completed",
      "count": 3,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "turn_completed",
      "count": 2,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "reopened-send-completed"
    },
    {
      "type": "accessibility",
      "label": "reopened-send-completed"
    },
    {
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "reopened-send-completed"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 142
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "wait_for_journal",
      "event_type": "session_created",
      "count": 2,
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "label": "second-session-created"
    },
    {
      "type": "accessibility",
      "label": "second-session-created"
    },
    {
      "type": "metrics",
      "label": "second-session-created"
    }
  ]
}
